INTERNAL NOTE - ON THE CHAIN ABOVE THE LEADER
Restricted. Not for general circulation.

Members are told the chain of command ends at Pain. For nearly all purposes it does,
and that is how it should stay.

There is, however, a hand above his. The masked man - "Tobi" to the field, Madara to
those permitted the name - is the founder's true heir and the organisation's real
will. He allows Pain the appearance of command because Nagato's belief drives the work,
and belief is more useful than a title.

If you have been shown this note, you are one of the few who must not mistake the
figurehead for the power. Do not correct anyone who has not. Do not speak the name.
The organisation functions because the many follow Pain and the few know better.
Be one of the few, quietly, or be a tool, contentedly. Either serves.
